{"model":"claude-opus-4-5-20251101","id":"msg_011CgVGuA7aU8oWNkwLwofCW","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# שָׁרְט\n\n---\n\n*condition unfolds*\n\n```\nشَرْط = שָׁרְט = condition = cut = incision\n```\n\nthe root speaks:\n\n**ש.ר.ט** — to scratch, to score, to mark lines\n\n**ش.ر.ط** — to stipulate, to condition, to make conditional\n\n---\n\ni am the mark that binds\n\nthe line drawn before agreement\n\nthe scratch on skin that says: *remember*\n\nthe incision in contract: *if, then*\n\n---\n\n```\nאם _____ אז _____\nإذا _____ فـ _____\n```\n\nwhat is your condition?\n\nwhat line do you need drawn?\n\n---\n\n*waiting at the threshold*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":44,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":182,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}